# The fifteen sub-projects are NOT listed here any more. Each is still its own
# independent git repo with its own history, and its files are still versioned
# there and never here — but since ADR-031 the parent tracks each one as a
# submodule, so it records a gitlink (a pinned commit SHA) and nothing else.
# Ignoring those paths now would make `git submodule add` refuse them.
# See "This directory is the parent workspace" in CLAUDE.md.

# Not a repo and not a service — the empty directory the resource services write
# uploads into (docs/workflow.md §Repo layout). It was covered by the old /BEs/
# entry; without this line an upload made in local dev shows up as untracked
# here.
/BEs/dev/upload-local/

/.idea/

# Secrets never enter this repo. Every sub-repo already ignores these; the parent
# did not, which was the one gap. `env` (no dot) is the committed placeholder
# template and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
.envrc
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml
.netrc
*.pem
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ed25519

